Alembic migrations for the SSAT Rankings Postgres database.

Run migrations:
    cd backend && alembic upgrade head

Create a new revision (autogenerate from model diffs):
    cd backend && alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Downgrade one step:
    cd backend && alembic downgrade -1

DATABASE_URL is read from app.core.config.settings (loaded from backend/.env).
